# The actual session-signing secret — not "data", a credential. If this were
# public, anyone could forge a valid admin login cookie and skip the
# password entirely. Real content (backend/database/*.json and images/) IS
# tracked in this repo by request; this is the one deliberate exception.
backend/.env
frontend/.env.local
